{
"text": "[image: My running mate Ben Steffen is making his way across rural Nebraska, sitting down with the people who keep this state running. He's hearing that Nebraskans are tired of being talked at instead of listened to, and tired of finding out about decisions after they're made. Ben and I will govern openly and honestly - because that's the only way it works.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddppn0DG1SE/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Nebraska is in play. Every week more Nebraskans join this campaign because they’re tired of a governor who turned a $1.2 billion surplus into a billion-dollar hole. Now some national experts see it too. Let’s finish the job 💪🏼] Cook Political Report @CookPolitical Today, the Cook Political Report is moving four governors' races, all in Democrats' direction. • Alaska: Toss Up to Lean Democrat • Oklahoma, Nebraska and Vermont: Solid Republican to Likely Republican",
"href": "https://twitter.com/CookPolitical/status/2110043644283457912"
},
{
"text": "[image: Thank you, Blair! Nights like this are the best part of this job. Great turnout at the Depot tonight and a lot of honest conversation about what Nebraskans are facing right now - and the kind of leadership it's going to take to change it. Forty days to go. Let's finish strong!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdsREVtm0lq/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Washington County - let's meet! Join me on Thursday, September 24 at 5:30pm at the Blair Deport for a meet-and-greet. Bring your neighbors, bring your questions. See you there!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdhiDdEGzw9/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Washington County, I'm headed your way! I'll be at Blair Deport at Lion's Park tonight at 5:30 for a meet-and-greet and listening session. Come say hello, and bring a neighbor! I can't wait to hear what's on your mind.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdrdE49G-EG/"
},
{
"text": "[image: We had a great weekend out on the campaign trail! We marched in the Applejack Festival Parade in Nebraska City and stopped by the Free Speech Society meeting to talk with folks about the issues that matter most. Nebraska values are running strong and taking us through Election Day!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdjhJa1Fkc3/"
